      "created_at": "2022-04-13T17:01:30.263Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My gf and I have been playing a fair bit of DE together and the one villain in the core box we consistently have a hard time having fun against is Omnitron. We’ve never had any troubles grinding out a win, but the way it just flips and runs down the big line of effects every turn without much variety feels like kind of a grind that we have a hard time getting the same type of enjoyment out of.</p>\n<p>Are we missing something or is it just a play style that isn’t to our personal taste? I’m fine with it being the latter, but if it’s the former I just don’t wanna keep missing out</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-04-13T17:01:30.263Z",
